cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use paleos-interior, please cite the PALEOS paper below, which describes
  the equations of state behind every profile, and this software.
title: PALEOSInterior
abstract: >-
  Interior profiles of rocky planets compatible with a measured mass and radius:
  an iron core under an MgSiO3 mantle in hydrostatic equilibrium on an adiabat,
  with material properties from the PALEOS equation-of-state tables.
type: software
